      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Contract, not chat",
      "items": [
        "The task file is what ZCode executes and what the review reads as your authorization",
        "Work happens in an isolated git worktree, never in the main checkout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "The gate never denies",
      "items": [
        "Writes outside the worktree always stop for a human",
        "Model review outputs allow or ask; failures fall back to ask",
        "Auto-approval requires an allow_once option"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Evidence beats narrative",
      "items": [
        "Accept with git diff and your test suite",
        "Every gate decision is an event in runs/<id>/events.jsonl",
        "One background runner per session; the CLI only reads files"
      ]
    }
